          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo Musa waandikisha avyalwa osi a kpwandza kahi ya Aiziraeli dza arivyolagizwa ni Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jumula ya avyalwa osi a kpwandza a chilume a umuri wa mwezi mmwenga kpwenderera arioandikpwa kulengana na madzina gao kala ni elufu mirongo miiri na mbiri magana mairi na mirongo sabaa na tahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
